<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Hertz Gold Plus Rewards Program</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans";
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  h1, h2, h3, h4 { margin-top: 0; }
  .header-logo { float: left; }
  .header-text { float: right; }
  .section-title { font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 15px; }
  td { padding: 8px 0; }
  .form-row { margin-bottom: 15px; }
  .form-label { display: inline-block; width: 150px; font-weight: bold; }
  .form-input { border-bottom: 1px solid #000; padding-bottom: 2px; }
  .checkbox-group label { font-weight: normal; margin-right: 15px; }
  .disclaimer { font-size: 10pt; line-height: 1.4; margin-top: 20px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <img src="placeholder_logo.png" alt="Logo" style="width: 100px; height: auto;">
    <h1 style="font-size: 24pt; margin-top: 10px;">WESTERN MICHIGAN UNIVERSITY</h1>
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">{{ university_address }}</p>
  </div>

  <h2 style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px;">Hertz Gold Plus Rewards Program</h2>

  <p>
    Signing up for <span data-field="program_name">{{ program_name }}</span> means you can bypass the regular rental counter at airports and proceed directly to your pre-assigned vehicle. At the Hertz Local Stadium Drive there is no waiting and your keys are ready for pickup inside. It also means you only have to complete one enrollment agreement and select your rental preferences one time. An additional benefit is that you will receive email receipts. As a Gold member, you will also be automatically enrolled in Hertz's frequent renter program in which you will be able to earn higher levels of Gold service, personal free day certificates, free upgrades and bonus frequent flyer miles.
  </p>

  <p>
    To participate in the <span data-field="program_name">{{ program_name }}</span> program, you are sharing some of your personal information directly with Hertz and will have access to their online systems. All passwords are to be treated as sensitive, confidential information. <span data-field="university_name">{{ university_name }}</span> staff and students should not use their Bronco Net ID and password when setting up user access on non WMU systems.
  </p>

  <p>
    Fill out the following enrollment agreement and fax it to Hertz at <span data-field="fax_number">{{ fax_number }}</span>. The required information is on page one on the left side and then sign on the bottom right of the first page. The remaining pages are terms for personal use of Hertz rentals and do not apply to our corporate contract. It could take up to two weeks to receive your Hertz Gold Plus Membership card.
  </p>

  <p>
    Making reservations are quicker using your Gold Plus membership number. Also, your Gold Plus membership number can be added into your AAA traveler profile and you will receive your membership benefits.
  </p>

  <p>
    For additional information or questions please contact Jennifer Halseth (<span data-field="contact_phone">{{ contact_phone }}</span>).
  </p>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <h3 style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px;">ENROLLMENT AGREEMENT</h3>

  <p>To enroll in <span data-field="program_name">{{ program_name }}</span> for rentals in the U.S. and Canada, just complete the short form below and return it in the enclosed envelope. Or, simply fax your completed form to us at <span data-field="fax_number">{{ fax_number }}</span>. Read the North American Enrollment Agreement Terms, which are part of this Enrollment Agreement, and the Summary of Optional Services, which accompany this Enrollment Agreement, before completing this form.</p>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <div style="width: 48%;">
      <div class="section-title">HERTZ GOLD PLUS REWARDS NUMBERS</div>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">(IF APPLICABLE)</p>
      <div class="form-row">
        <span class="form-label">HERTZ CDP NUMBER:</span>
        <span class="form-input">{{ hertz_cdp_number }}</span>
      </div>
      <div class="form-row">
        <span class="form-label">WESTERN MICHIGAN UNIVERSITY:</span>
        <span class="form-input">{{ university_name }}</span>
      </div>
      <div class="form-row">
        <span class="form-label">ACCOUNT NAME OF CDP NUMBER (IF APPLICABLE):</span>
        <span class="form-input">{{ account_name }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 48%;">
      <div class="section-title">CUSTOMER'S CHOICE TO LIMIT USE OF DATA:</div>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">By signing this form, you agree to allow Hertz to use your personal information to participate in offers and services which we believe would be of interest to you, where legally permissible. You understand that you may opt out of receiving such communications at any time. You agree that Hertz may use your personal information to provide you with rental services and related communications. You agree to the terms and conditions of the North American Enrollment Agreement Terms, which are part of this Enrollment Agreement. You acknowledge that you have read and understood the terms and conditions of the North American Enrollment Agreement Terms. You agree to allow Hertz to use your personal information for marketing purposes. You understand that you may opt out of receiving such communications at any time. You agree to the terms and conditions of the North American Enrollment Agreement Terms. You agree to allow Hertz to use your personal information for marketing purposes. You understand that you may opt out of receiving such communications at any time. You agree to the terms and conditions of the North American Enrollment Agreement Terms.</p>
      <div class="form-row">
        <span class="form-label">1. You give Hertz permission to send you marketing offers and materials as follows:</span>
        <div class="checkbox-group">
          <label><input type="radio" name="marketing_opt_in" value="yes"> Yes</label>
          <label><input type="radio" name="marketing_opt_in" value="no"> No</label>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="form-row">
        <span class="form-label">2. You give Hertz permission to share personally identifiable data about you with Hertz's affiliates and business partners for marketing purposes:</span>
        <div class="checkbox-group">
          <label><input type="radio" name="data_sharing_opt_in" value="yes"> Yes</label>
          <label><input type="radio" name="data_sharing_opt_in" value="no"> No</label>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="form-row">
        <span class="form-label">3. You do not wish to receive promotional offers or materials from Hertz or its affiliates:</span>
        <div class="checkbox-group">
          <label><input type="radio" name="no_promo_opt_in" value="yes"> Yes</label>
          <label><input type="radio" name="no_promo_opt_in" value="no"> No</label>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <div style="width: 48%;">
      <div class="section-title">HOME ADDRESS</div>
      <div class="form-row">
        <span class="form-label">MR. [ ] MRS. [ ] MS. [ ] DR. [ ] OTHER [ ]</span>
      </div>
      <div class="form-row">
        <span class="form-label">FIRST:</span>
        <span class="form-input">{{ first_name }}</span>
      </div>
      <div class="form-row">
        <span class="form-label">M.I.:</span>
        <span class="form-input">{{ middle_initial }}</span>
      </div>
      <div class="form-row">
        <span class="form-label">LAST:</span>
        <span class="form-input">{{ last_name }}</span>
      </div>
      <div class="form-row">
        <span class="form-label">HOME ADDRESS:</span>
        <span class="form-input">{{ home_address_line1 }}</span>
      </div>
      <div class="form-row">
        <span class="form-label">HOME ADDRESS (CONTINUED):</span>
        <span class="form-input">{{ home_address_line2 }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 48%;">
      <div class="section-title">U.S. OPTIONAL SERVICES/CAR CLASS:</div>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Please check the box next to the service or car class you wish to have added to your rental agreement.</p>
      <div class="form-row">
        <span class="form-label">CAR CLASS:</span>
        <div class="checkbox-group">
          <label><input type="checkbox" name="car_class_option" value="compact"> Compact</label>
          <label><input type="checkbox" name="car_class_option" value="midsize"> Midsize</label>
          <label><input type="checkbox" name="car_class_option" value="fullsize"> Fullsize</label>
          <label><input type="checkbox" name="car_class_option" value="suv"> SUV</label>
          <label><input type="checkbox" name="car_class_option" value="luxury"> Luxury</label>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="form-row">
        <span class="form-label">INSURANCE:</span>
        <div class="checkbox-group">
          <label><input type="checkbox" name="insurance_option" value="waiver"> Waiver</label>
          <label><input type="checkbox" name="insurance_option" value="none"> None</label>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="form-row">
        <span class="form-label">ADDITIONAL SERVICES:</span>
        <div class="checkbox-group">
          <label><input type="checkbox" name="add_on_service" value="gps"> GPS</label>
          <label><input type="checkbox" name="add_on_service" value="child_seat"> Child Seat</label>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <div style="width: 48%;">
      <div class="section-title">CITY, STATE/PROVINCE, ZIP/POSTAL CODE</div>
      <div class="form-row">
        <span class="form-label">CITY:</span>
        <span class="form-input">{{ city }}</span>
      </div>
      <div class="form-row">
        <span class="form-label">STATE/PROVINCE:</span>
        <span class="form-input">{{ state_province }}</span>
      </div>
      <div class="form-row">
        <span class="form-label">ZIP/POSTAL CODE:</span>
        <span class="form-input">{{ zip_postal_code }}</span>
      </div>
      <div class="form-row">
        <span class="form-label">COMPANY ADDRESS:</span>
        <span class="form-input">{{ company_address_line1 }}</span>
      </div>
      <div class="form-row">
        <span class="form-label">COMPANY ADDRESS (CONTINUED):</span>
        <span class="form-input">{{ company_address_line2 }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 48%;">
      <div class="section-title">CANADA OPTIONAL SERVICES/CAR CLASS:</div>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Please check the box next to the service or car class you wish to have added to your rental agreement.</p>
      <div class="form-row">
        <span class="form-label">CAR CLASS:</span>
        <div class="checkbox-group">
          <label><input type="checkbox" name="car_class_canada" value="compact"> Compact</label>
          <label><input type="checkbox" name="car_class_canada" value="midsize"> Midsize</label>
          <label><input type="checkbox" name="car_class_canada" value="fullsize"> Fullsize</label>
          <label><input type="checkbox" name="car_class_canada" value="suv"> SUV</label>
          <label><input type="checkbox" name="car_class_canada" value="luxury"> Luxury</label>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="form-row">
        <span class="form-label">INSURANCE:</span>
        <div class="checkbox-group">
          <label><input type="checkbox" name="insurance_canada_option" value="waiver"> Waiver</label>
          <label><input type="checkbox" name="insurance_canada_option" value="none"> None</label>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="form-row">
        <span class="form-label">ADDITIONAL SERVICES:</span>
        <div class="checkbox-group">
          <label><input type="checkbox" name="add_on_service_canada" value="gps"> GPS</label>
          <label><input type="checkbox" name="add_on_service_canada" value="child_seat"> Child Seat</label>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <div style="width: 48%;">
      <div class="section-title">PERSONAL INFORMATION (mandatory for enrollment):</div>
      <div class="form-row">
        <span class="form-label">DATE OF BIRTH:</span>
        <span class="form-input">{{ dob_day }}</span> / <span class="form-input">{{ dob_month }}</span> / <span class="form-input">{{ dob_year }}</span>
      </div>
      <div class="form-row">
        <span class="form-label">DRIVER'S LICENSE NUMBER:</span>
        <span class="form-input">{{ driver_license_number }}</span>
      </div>
      <div class="form-row">
        <span class="form-label">STATE/PROVINCE:</span>
        <span class="form-input">{{ license_state_province }}</span>
      </div>
      <div class="form-row">
        <span class="form-label">EXPIRATION DATE:</span>
        <span class="form-input">{{ license_expiry_day }}</span> / <span class="form-input">{{ license_expiry_month }}</span> / <span class="form-input">{{ license_expiry_year }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 48%;">
      <div class="section-title">ELECTIONS FOR U.S. AND CANADA:</div>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">These options apply to both the U.S. and Canada.</p>
      <div class="form-row">
        <span class="form-label">I authorize Hertz to use my personal information to provide pick-up regarding my rental reservation:</span>
        <div class="checkbox-group">
          <label><input type="checkbox" name="auth_use_data" value="yes"> Yes</label>
          <label><input type="checkbox" name="auth_use_data" value="no"> No</label>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="form-row">
        <span class="form-label">I authorize Hertz to use my personal information to provide rental services and related communications:</span>
        <div class="checkbox-group">
          <label><input type="checkbox" name="auth_rental_services" value="yes"> Yes</label>
          <label><input type="checkbox" name="auth_rental_services" value="no"> No</label>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="form-row">
        <span class="form-label">I authorize Hertz to use my personal information to provide marketing offers and materials:</span>
        <div class="checkbox-group">
          <label><input type="checkbox" name="auth_marketing" value="yes"> Yes</label>
          <label><input type="checkbox" name="auth_marketing" value="no"> No</label>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 40px;">
    <p style="font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;">Please sign and fax to (<span data-field="fax_number">{{ fax_number }}</span>)</p>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <div style="width: 48%;">
      <div class="section-title">SUMMARY OF OPTIONAL SERVICES AVAILABLE FOR RENTALS IN THE UNITED STATES AND CANADA</div>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">This is a summary only and is subject to all of the provisions, limitations and exceptions of the applicable liability insurance policy. This summary is not a contract and does not constitute a warranty or guarantee of coverage. For information regarding the optional loss damage waiver, please refer to the applicable insurance policy.</p>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">For information regarding the optional services, please refer to the applicable insurance policy.</p>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 48%;">
      <div class="section-title">HOW TO OBTAIN PAID/PEACE COVERAGE</div>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">If you indicate that you wish to purchase optional coverage, you will be required to sign a separate agreement and pay the applicable premium at the time of rental. The premium for optional coverage is subject to change without notice. The premium for optional coverage is subject to the terms and conditions of the applicable insurance policy.</p>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">The optional coverage is not a guarantee of coverage and is subject to the terms and conditions of the applicable insurance policy.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <div style="width: 48%;">
      <div class="section-title">1. LIABILITY INSURANCE SUPPLEMENT (LIS): SUMMARY OF COVERAGE IN THE UNITED STATES ONLY</div>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">If you elect to purchase LIS, coverage will be provided to you and your passengers for liability for bodily injury and property damage to third parties caused by the rental vehicle. The coverage is subject to the terms and conditions of the applicable insurance policy.</p>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">LIS provides protection from third-party automobile liability claims for the damages caused by the rental vehicle. The coverage is subject to the terms and conditions of the applicable insurance policy.</p>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">LIS does not cover damage to the rental vehicle itself or damage to your personal property.</p>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">LIS is not a substitute for personal automobile insurance.</p>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 48%;">
      <div class="section-title">2. PERSONAL ACCIDENT INSURANCE (PAI) AND PERSONAL EFFECTS COVERAGE (PEC): SUMMARY OF COVERAGES.</div>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">PAI provides coverage for bodily injury to you and your passengers resulting from an accident involving the rental vehicle. PEC provides coverage for personal property damage to you and your passengers resulting from an accident involving the rental vehicle.</p>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">PAI and PEC are subject to the terms and conditions of the applicable insurance policy.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <div style="width: 48%;">
      <div class="section-title">EXCLUSIONS</div>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">The following are examples of exclusions and are not an exhaustive list. Coverage is subject to the terms and conditions of the applicable insurance policy.</p>
      <ul style="font-size: 10pt; padding-left: 20px;">
        <li>Damage to the rental vehicle caused by the negligence of the renter.</li>
        <li>Damage to the rental vehicle caused by illegal acts.</li>
        <li>Damage to the rental vehicle caused by weather events.</li>
        <li>Damage to the rental vehicle caused by acts of war.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 48%;">
      <div class="section-title">EXCLUSIONS</div>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">The following are examples of exclusions and are not an exhaustive list. Coverage is subject to the terms and conditions of the applicable insurance policy.</p>
      <ul style="font-size: 10pt; padding-left: 20px;">
        <li>Damage to the rental vehicle caused by the negligence of the renter.</li>
        <li>Damage to the rental vehicle caused by illegal acts.</li>
        <li>Damage to the rental vehicle caused by weather events.</li>
        <li>Damage to the rental vehicle caused by acts of war.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <div style="width: 48%;">
      <div class="section-title">11. NOTICE TO RENTERS REGARDING DAMAGE WAIVERS</div>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">If you purchase a damage waiver, you are waiving your right to recover damages from Hertz for damage to the rental vehicle. This waiver is subject to the terms and conditions of the applicable insurance policy.</p>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Damage waivers do not cover damage to your personal property.</p>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 48%;">
      <div class="section-title">12. AVAILABILITY OF GOLD SERVICE AT SPECIFIC LOCATIONS</div>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Gold Service is available at select locations only. You must confirm availability at the time of reservation.</p>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">The availability of Gold Service is subject to change without notice.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <div style="width: 48%;">
      <div class="section-title">13. REPRESENTATION OF INFORMATION</div>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">You represent that the information you have provided to Hertz is true and correct. You agree to indemnify Hertz against any claims arising from false or incomplete information.</p>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 48%;">
      <div class="section-title">14. AUTHORIZATION TO PROCESS ALL CHARGES</div>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">You authorize Hertz to process all charges in any way deemed necessary to complete your rental agreement, including any fees, taxes, and surcharges.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 50px;">
    <p style="font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;">YOUR SIGNATURE (MUST SIGN TO BE ELIGIBLE)</p>
    <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; width: 300px; margin: 20px auto;"></div>
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">DATE</p>
  </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>